      "message": "B. This is the only call to `handle_inter_mode()`. Note that `rd_stats_y` and `rd_stats_uv` are passed to `handle_inter_mode()` uninitialized.",
      "revId": "99c08b9f89de7dc6b97f33c96242b7f3bd33255f",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
